l if absorbed through skin. May cause skin irritation.  \nEyes: May cause eye irritation.  \nIngestion: May be harmful if swallowed.  \n\n## 3. COMPOSITION/INFORMATION ON INGREDIENTS\n\nSynonyms: Piperazine-1,4-bis(2-ethanesulfonic acid)  \n1,4-Piperazinediethanesulfonic acid  \nPiperazine-N,N'-bis(2-ethanesulfonic acid)  \n\nFormula: C8H18N2O6S2  \nMolecular Weight: 302.37 g/mol\n\n<table id=\"e1\">\n<tr>\n<th>CAS-No.</th>\n<th>EC-No.</th>\n<th>Index-No.</th>\n<th>Concentration</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><strong>2,2'-(Piperazine-1,4-diyl)bis(ethanesulphonic) acid</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5625-37-6</td>\n<td>227-057-6</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n## 4. FIRST AID MEASURES\n\nIf inhaled  \nIf breathed in, move person into fresh air. If not breathing, give artificial respiration.  \n\nSigma - P6757  \nPage 1 of 5--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPIPES = 99 titration 5625-37-6 (https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/NL/en/product/sigma/p6757)\nciteturn92search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; 5625-37-6 ... Sigma-Aldrich P6757 PIPES[Button: Quick View]  | Sigma-Aldrich 80635 PIPES[Button: Quick View]  | Sigma-Aldrich RDD004 PIPES[Button: Quick View]  | Sigma-Aldrich P8203 PIPES[Button: Quick View]\n\nP6757\n\nImage: PIPES &#8805;99% (titration)\n\nImage: PIPES &#8805;99% (titration)Image: PIPES &#8805;99% (titration)+3\n\n# PIPES\n\n## ≥99% (titration)\n\n(0)\n\n[Button: Write a review]\n\n[Button: Ask a question]\n\nSynonym(s):\n\n1,4-Piperazinediethanesulfonic acid, Piperazine-1,4-bis(2-ethanesulfonic acid), Piperazine-N,N′-bis(2-ethanesulfonic acid)\n\nSign In to View Organizational & Contract Pricing.\n\n### Select a Size\n\nChange View\n\nSize/SKU  | Availability  | Price\n--- | --- | ---\n25 g P6757-25G  | Please contact Customer Service for Availability  | €62.30\n100 g P6757-100G  | Please contact Customer Service for Availability  | €232.00\n500 g P6757-500G  | Please contact Custom